  "sourceFindings": [
    "Orange anthropomorphic bandicoot with cream muzzle/belly, large triangular ears and long muzzle, rounded dark nose, reddish spiked forelock, broad brown brows and green irises.",
    "Blue rolled-trouser legs, brown fingerless gloves and red sneakers with pale laces/soles; no shoes, gloves or arm anatomy imported from Sonic.",
    "Aku Aku shown as an animate companion character, not a detachable weapon or inert equipment item. CG02 should study actual shoes/gloves if the equipment-only slot is retained.",
    "Stylized proportions and digit count must be compared to the actual Crash4 images, not replaced by a human five-finger rule."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "New CG scenes would be original compositions; inspected screenshots do not certify exact recreation of levels or new special costumes.",
    "Small textures, soles hidden by perspective and complete unseen rear geometry are not fully established.",
    "No perfect 1:1 fidelity approval results from qualification of the source."
  ],
